{"type":"standard","title":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Texas","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Texas</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q131632172","titles":{"canonical":"2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Texas","normalized":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Texas","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Texas</span></span>"},"pageid":78639082,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Seal_of_Texas.svg/330px-Seal_of_Texas.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":330},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Seal_of_Texas.svg/960px-Seal_of_Texas.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":524,"height":524},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1378046057","tid":"f8d68fa8-be83-11f1-974b-b571a36b22c6","timestamp":"2026-10-02T17:09:05Z","description":"","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Texas","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Texas?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Texas?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Texas"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Texas","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Texas","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Texas?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Texas"}},"extract":"The 2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Texas will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the thirty-eight U.S. representatives from the state of Texas, one from each of the state's thirty-eight congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The primary elections took place on March 3, 2026, and in races where no candidate receives over 50% in a primary, runoff elections took place on May 26.","extract_html":"<p>The <b>2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Texas</b> will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the thirty-eight U.S. representatives from the state of Texas, one from each of the state's thirty-eight congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The primary elections took place on March 3, 2026, and in races where no candidate receives over 50% in a primary, runoff elections took place on May 26.</p>"}